OL,3,A'Cheeky' fees prompts choirs to pull
OL,4,Aout of Andrea Bocelli gig
OL,5,
OL,6,FWales is the land of song, but there
OL,7,Fmay be distinct lack of voices at a
OL,8,Ffestival in the Principality Stadium
OL,9,Fnext year, because choirs are being
OL,10,Fcharged thousands of pounds to take
OL,11,Fpart.
OL,13,FThe event, billed as the The Land of
OL,14,FSong Festival, will feature
OL,15,Fworld-renowned Italian Tenor Andrea
OL,16,FBocelli, but choirs are pulling out
OL,17,Fbecause of steep costs that include
OL,18,Ffees for individual singers.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
